        <bannerTitle>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Blog Details]]></Value>
    </bannerTitle>
                        <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "acb5fef2-88fc-4690-abda-8010a2fe7b30",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-rcm-story\">\n<section class=\"rcm-intro\" aria-labelledby=\"rcm-intro-title\">\n    <div class=\"rcm-intro__content\">\n      <p class=\"rcm-kicker\">Revenue Cycle Management</p>\n      <h2 class=\"rcm-intro__title\" id=\"rcm-intro-title\">\n        Turn the Revenue Cycle Into a <span>Performance Engine</span>\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"rcm-intro__copy\">\n        Efficient billing and collections are essential for healthcare stability and growth. Centro provides tailored RCM solutions designed to reduce errors, accelerate reimbursements, and improve cash-flow visibility.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"rcm-intro__copy\">\n        From claim submission and payer follow-up to denial management and patient billing, our teams help providers protect revenue while keeping their focus on care delivery.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"rcm-intro__tags\" aria-label=\"RCM priorities\">\n        <span class=\"rcm-intro__tag\">Fewer Delays</span>\n        <span class=\"rcm-intro__tag\">Stronger Accuracy</span>\n        <span class=\"rcm-intro__tag\">Better Visibility</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rcm-engine\" aria-label=\"Revenue cycle performance illustration\">\n      <span class=\"rcm-engine__orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <span class=\"rcm-engine__center\">\n        <span>\n          <strong>RCM</strong>\n          <small>Performance</small>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"rcm-engine__node rcm-engine__node--claim\">Clean Claims</span>\n      <span class=\"rcm-engine__node rcm-engine__node--payment\">Payments</span>\n      <span class=\"rcm-engine__node rcm-engine__node--insight\">Visibility</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "31e33420-e5dc-4a3b-998a-c85278d04594",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-rcm-story\">\n<section class=\"rcm-challenges\" aria-labelledby=\"rcm-challenges-title\">\n    <p class=\"rcm-kicker\">The Revenue Challenge</p>\n    <h2 class=\"rcm-section-title\" id=\"rcm-challenges-title\">What Healthcare Providers Are Navigating</h2>\n    <p class=\"rcm-section-copy\">\n      Complex payer requirements, evolving regulations, claim denials, and coding errors can slow reimbursement and create avoidable revenue leakage. The industry benchmarks below show how widespread the challenge has become.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"rcm-benchmark-grid\">\n      <article class=\"rcm-benchmark\">\n        <div class=\"rcm-benchmark__value\">~12%</div>\n        <h3>Initial Claim Denial Rate</h3>\n        <p>The average initial denial rate was reported at nearly 12% in 2023, compared with 10.15% in 2020.</p>\n        <span class=\"rcm-benchmark__source\">Simbo.ai, 2023</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"rcm-benchmark\">\n        <div class=\"rcm-benchmark__value\">38%</div>\n        <h3>Providers Reporting Frequent Denials</h3>\n        <p>More than one-third of providers reported that at least one in every ten claims is denied.</p>\n        <span class=\"rcm-benchmark__source\">Experian, 2024</span>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"rcm-benchmark\">\n        <div class=\"rcm-benchmark__value rcm-benchmark__value--icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n            <path d=\"M4 4h16v16H4zM8 9h8M8 13h5M8 17h3\" />\n            <path d=\"m15 15 4 4M19 15l-4 4\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Coding and Requirement Gaps</h3>\n        <p>Incorrect coding and missed insurance requirements can contribute significantly to delayed or lost revenue.</p>\n        <span class=\"rcm-benchmark__source\">Advisory Board, 2021</span>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "40c5210e-9727-4dfe-b5e7-218a6f996d9c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-rcm-story\">\n<section class=\"rcm-outcomes\" aria-labelledby=\"rcm-outcomes-title\">\n    <p class=\"rcm-kicker\">Industry-Reported Outcomes</p>\n    <h2 class=\"rcm-section-title\" id=\"rcm-outcomes-title\">What Outsourced RCM Can Help Unlock</h2>\n    <p class=\"rcm-section-copy\">\n      The right outsourcing model can strengthen cost efficiency, collections, and claim quality while giving internal teams more capacity to focus on care and operational priorities.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"rcm-outcomes__grid\">\n      <article class=\"rcm-outcome\">\n        <span class=\"rcm-outcome__value\">30–40%</span>\n        <h3>Lower Billing Costs</h3>\n        <p>Reported cost reduction when outsourcing RCM compared with maintaining in-house billing teams.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rcm-outcome\">\n        <span class=\"rcm-outcome__value\">5–15%</span>\n        <h3>Collection Improvement</h3>\n        <p>Reported improvement in revenue collections with outsourced billing and claims management.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rcm-outcome\">\n        <span class=\"rcm-outcome__value\">30–60%</span>\n        <h3>Fewer Claim Rejections</h3>\n        <p>Reported reduction in claim rejections during the first three months of outsourcing.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"rcm-outcomes__note\">These figures are industry benchmarks cited in the article’s original sources. Actual results vary by provider, starting performance, scope, payer mix, and operating model.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
